{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1ae5c7eb047879cd36bdff29049e89ec87f46d6533469eb40fd05505fed8090c", "ja": "あれ？　育じゃないか。\nどうしたんだ、今日は休みだったよな？", "zh": "哎？这不是育吗。\n怎么了，今天不是休息吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "6a49b1921247ad1033f41c1915ada35629b58fb1f07395426e0fa1b2d673320c", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nえへへ、ちょっと約束があって……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n嘿嘿，我和人有个约定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "84b8f9fbcf4f5b1b767f8194f3fd5be7d198c45cc77544bf8a90bd26353f91eb", "ja": "それより{$P$}さん、どう？\n今日のわたし、いつもと違うって思わない？", "zh": "比起那个，{$P$}先生，怎么样？\n你有没有觉得，今天的我和往常不一样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1003_p", "source_sha256": "165f60172e476a8d39f9d9a930e2b54b757420fd272125b5f29dc28daa527fc1", "ja": "あぁ、今日はすごくオシャレだな。", "zh": "啊，今天特别时髦呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "e084d294dc6d2ed5a59418a5cc28422ed7f52fb1e35d2bf95249d21edb7af6c8", "ja": "えへへ、正解♪　このお洋服ね、おかあさんと一緒に\n選んだの！　かわいいでしょ？", "zh": "嘿嘿，答对了♪这身衣服是我和妈妈一起挑的！很可爱吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1005_p", "source_sha256": "38814f2ebc67eae3a6a1ef6d1c534b757e5c02d27485ae2d1e5367bdd63d4c0a", "ja": "うん、よく似合ってるし可愛いよ。\nでもそれだけじゃ……あ、少しメイクしてるのか？", "zh": "嗯，很适合你，也很可爱。\n不过还不止这些……啊，你还化了点妆吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "2997f29bd39c921ebdfa31fcbc9bf389b9c6293bbaf7df39c9a87e29f2856e0a", "ja": "そっちも正解！　{$P$}さんなら\nぜったい、気づいてくれると思ったんだ♪", "zh": "这个答案也对！我就知道是{$P$}先生的话，你肯定会注意到的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "cf58d78970edef8582de3be9489df8e3175a020a8abf07d715c7ef62b71d602b", "ja": "前に、桃子ちゃん達とコスメのお仕事をしたでしょ？\nその時に、もっと知りたいって思ったの。", "zh": "之前不是和桃子她们一起做过彩妆的工作吗？\n那时候我就想着，想再多了解一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "63a4ba6de6f1805eaa67330f0f5e74599f20c304ae6b3ca5484108e8b05a06de", "ja": "それでね、恵美さんやこのみさんに、\nいろいろ教えてもらってたんだ！", "zh": "所以啊，我一直在向惠美姐姐和木实姐姐请教各种各样的事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ceec416eb000e82791de4bed406132ecb5bce4568270068da34125f5ff85d782", "ja": "そうだったのか。メイクは奥が深いって聞くからな。\nでも恵美達なら、先生にピッタリだ。", "zh": "原来如此。我听说化妆可是很有深度的。不过要是惠美她们的话，当老师肯定很合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "dcb6c94c2a630f48aaed1dc05184935e8d73be8ace6c179ee58190913df206ed", "ja": "うん！　いっぱい教えてもらっちゃった。\nこのお洋服に似合う色とか、わたしに似合う色とか。", "zh": "嗯！她教了我好多东西。\n比如适合这身衣服的颜色，还有适合我的颜色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "94a33632056ba94fc79540217fbb4eac26582de50a896eb1d3356637704daf14", "ja": "メイクもお洋服に合わせたから、\n髪型も、ちょっとだけオシャレにしてもらったの♪", "zh": "因为妆容也配合了这身衣服，所以发型也让人帮我稍微弄得时髦了一点♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1012_p", "source_sha256": "eaff5e405761762e95fcc0b2130c964eda4f228b6d4d28f14e7f5074dc7d0b6f", "ja": "なるほど。勉強しながら、\nかわいくしてもらったのか。はは、よかったな。", "zh": "原来如此。你是一边学习，一边变得可爱了啊。哈哈，那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "679df30d17dfb720966eb98c75a5ba976929cfd2b5b2fb19926247f0834c2f1c", "ja": "えへへ。明日学校に行くの楽しみだなぁ。今日教えて\nもらったこと、今度はわたしが教えてあげるんだ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，好期待明天去学校啊。今天学到的东西，下次就由我来教给大家♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0e4ddabbf9da4b992fa418392c16607fb9f788dccead785c4e7e872af607cb41", "ja": "それはいいな！　お友達も喜ぶと思うよ。\n……育はどんどんお姉さんになっていくなぁ。", "zh": "这很好啊！你的朋友们肯定也会很开心。\n……育也越来越像个大姐姐了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "45218f70e30fa95f0606725a7985b07df11624cc0ec1d5da378985d0360c77c0", "ja": "お姉さん……！\nでもわたし、もっともっと早く大きくなりたい！", "zh": "姐姐……！\n可是我想快一点长大，成为真正的大姐姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "b32cc34bdca53a90eb569f573b11ad915b8f6f93fb0e3293ca15dcb049107cc0", "ja": "メイクも、お洋服も、髪型も……\nもっと勉強したら、早くお姉さんになれるかな？", "zh": "化妆、衣服、发型……\n如果再多学习一些，是不是就能快点长成大姐姐了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1017_p", "source_sha256": "85228d42771d8914698c70f9c8231a2e003c94404ac041a829ce06188298457e", "ja": "もちろん！　育が頑張れば、すぐになれるよ。", "zh": "当然了！只要育努力的话，马上就能变成大姐姐的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "bc7e6f0255b14bbf3ebae823aeeca3effd6dcfd04016a545ff651e1467dadd75", "ja": "ほんと？　じゃあわたし、いっぱいがんばるね！\n今日はみんなに手伝ってもらっちゃったけど……。", "zh": "真的吗？那我会加油的！\n虽然今天让大家帮了我不少……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "dcfadb3951866546861276c1911e4d8ef1ec984a6890d9e202547cf1c0ddad22", "ja": "お姉さんになるなら、\nちゃんと全部自分でできるようにならないと！", "zh": "如果要成为大姐姐，就必须学会把所有事情都做好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0524_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "3daea26e40b2f164ac0233b6a811ce31f6d0f8c8274a686efd5efdbe00a7042d", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nわたし、ステキなお姉さんになるから応えんしてね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n我会成为帅气的大姐姐，你要为我加油哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
